# industry-closure-pack input contract (shipped EMPTY).
#
# A consumer or a ProfilePack supplies the industry side here, as Turtle only:
#   - an ic:IndustryClosure with ic:baseIri and scope;
#   - ic:KnowledgeSource records (ADMITTED / EXCLUDED / UNKNOWN);
#   - ic:Requirement rows and capability individuals;
#   - any known ABBs, contracts, SBBs and evidence in the ea: shape;
#   - the epoch-0 snapshot and later snapshots, coverages and residuals.
# Gates 010-100 judge the merged graph. Nothing in this file is authority:
# packs here SELECT and CONSTRUCT only, never DO.
#
# qualification/project/ontology/industry-input.ttl overlays this file with a
# synthetic industry at the same relative path when the pack is qualified.

@prefix ic: <https://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/industry-closure-pack#> .
@prefix ea: <https://chatman.ai/ontology/enterprise-architecture#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
